test/fixtures/mapping-lib-0.9.0 contains the mapping files of the 0.9.0 tag of the
FHIRconnect mapping library (https://github.com/SevKohler/FHIRconnect-mapping-lib),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its
projects/org.highmed/KDS/resources/openehr/templates folder holds the KDS operational
templates of the same library (main branch), under the same license.

src/server/models/fhir-r4.json is generated from the FHIR R4 (4.0.1) definitions
published by HL7 International (http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/downloads.html), which are
released under the Creative Commons "No Rights Reserved" (CC0) license. FHIR is a
registered trademark of HL7 and is used with the permission of HL7.

The path resolution follows the behaviour of the openFHIR engine
(https://github.com/medblocks/openFHIR), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The v0.9.0 grammar in src/server/grammar is derived from the model classes and JSON
schemas of the openFHIR engine (https://github.com/medblocks/openFHIR), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Key descriptions follow the FHIRconnect specification
(https://github.com/SevKohler/FHIRconnect-spec), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
